            "ReferenceError: Comment is not defined in deleteArticle was hidden behind NotFound/Validation errors"
          ],
          "fix": "report only real crashes; deterministic import-fixer codemod adds used-but-unimported model/helper names (-> 104/104)",
          "root_cause": "harness: crash list drowned in control-flow errors; missing import never surfaced"
        },
